    <node id="sym:repo2graph/answer.py::_ollama_base">
      <data key="d0">sym:repo2graph/answer.py::_ollama_base</data>
      <data key="d1">symbol</data>
      <data key="d2">_ollama_base</data>
      <data key="d10">_ollama_base</data>
      <data key="d11">function</data>
      <data key="d3">repo2graph/answer.py</data>
      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">184</data>
      <data key="d13">198</data>
      <data key="d14">def _ollama_base(value: str) -&gt; str:</data>
      <data key="d15">Normalise OLLAMA_HOST to an http(s) base URL.

    `ollama serve` documents (and exports) the schemeless `127.0.0.1:11434`,
    which urlopen rejects with `unknown url type: 127.0.0.1`. Default the
    scheme to http and refuse anything that is not http(s), so a stray
    `file://` value cannot turn into an urlopen target.</data>
      <data key="d_nodegraphics">
        <y:ShapeNode>
