      <data key="d14">def _warn_locking_unavailable(path: str, exc: BaseException | None) -&gt; None:</data>
      <data key="d15">Say once that records are being appended without an advisory lock.

    Records are still written -- that is the point -- but they are no longer
    serialised against other processes sharing the file, and an operator
    reading a shredded line later deserves to know why rather than to guess.

    Args:
        path: The audit sink the lock could not be taken on.
        exc: What the locking call raised, when it raised at all.</data>
      <data key="d_nodegraphics">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry x="3919.00" y="689.15" width="133.10" height="28.60" />
