      <data key="d14">def get(self, key: str) -&gt; Any:</data>
      <data key="d15">Return the cached value for `key`, or None when there is none.

        An expired entry is dropped and counted as a miss, so a caller cannot
        tell "expired" from "never seen" -- which is the point.

        Args:
            key: A key from `make_key`.

        Returns:
            The cached value, or None.</data>
      <data key="d16">true</data>
