      <data key="d1">symbol</data>
      <data key="d2">check_parsers</data>
      <data key="d10">check_parsers</data>
      <data key="d11">function</data>
      <data key="d3">repo2graph/doctor.py</data>
      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">1171</data>
      <data key="d13">1271</data>
      <data key="d14">def check_parsers(path: Path) -&gt; CheckResult:</data>
      <data key="d15">Parse failures and unparsed file types in an index that already exists.

    check_tree_sitter answers "can this machine load the grammars"; this one
    answers "did they work on this repository" -- a grammar that loads fine
    still produces a symbol-free file node when the source uses syntax it does
    not model, and that file is then reachable by text but has no CALLS edges.</data>
      <data key="d_nodegraphics">
        <y:ShapeNode>
