      <data key="d14">def check_ignored_paths(path: Path) -&gt; CheckResult:</data>
      <data key="d15">What discovery left out, and whether that is more than the user expects.

    The failure this catches is silent: a repository whose source lives under
    a directory name that happens to be in DEFAULT_SKIP_DIRS (`build/`,
    `target/`, `dist/`) indexes cleanly and answers every question with
    nothing, because most of it was never discovered.</data>
