      <data key="d13">68</data>
      <data key="d14">def _npy_write(path: Path, rows: list, cols: int) -&gt; None:</data>
      <data key="d15">Write `rows` (a list of equal-length float sequences) as NPY v1.0.

    Opened "wb" with no encoding: a text-mode write on Windows rewrites every
    0x0A inside the binary payload and corrupts the file silently.</data>
