      <data key="d10">load_vectors</data>
      <data key="d11">function</data>
      <data key="d3">repo2graph/embed.py</data>
      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">234</data>
      <data key="d13">276</data>
      <data key="d14">def load_vectors(path) -&gt; tuple[dict[str, list[float]], dict]:</data>
      <data key="d15">Inverse of write_vectors: ({chunk id: vector}, meta).

    Raises ValueError/OSError on anything malformed; callers that must not fail
    (query.Index) catch both and fall back to BM25.</data>
