      <data key="d14">def write_overview_human(g: "Graph", path: Path, top: int = 25) -&gt; None:</data>
      <data key="d15">Structured, scannable repo map for `human/overview.md`.

    Unlike `write_overview` (still the agent/overview.md prose, unchanged),
    this reads edge-type and symbol-kind counts straight out of `g.stats`
    rather than rescanning `g.nodes`/`g.edges`, per the repo convention that
    `g.stats` is the single source of truth for those counts.</data>
