      <data key="d14">def register_written(outdir: Path | str, names: Iterable[str]) -&gt; bool:</data>
      <data key="d15">Merge `names` into an existing manifest's `written`, `files`, and `checksums`.

    `embed` runs after `build` as a separate command, so it must append to the
    manifest dump_all already wrote rather than rewrite it: every other key --
    counts, entrypoints, how_to_read -- is left exactly as it was. Returns
    False when there is no readable manifest to append to.</data>
