      <data key="d14">def _atomic_dir_swap(staging: Path, target: Path) -&gt; None:</data>
      <data key="d15">Atomically replace target directory with staging directory.

    On Windows, os.replace doesn't work for non-empty directories, so we use
    a rename dance: target -&gt; backup, staging -&gt; target, then remove backup.
    If the staging rename fails, we restore the backup.</data>
