      <data key="d2">_impact_root</data>
      <data key="d10">_impact_root</data>
      <data key="d11">function</data>
      <data key="d3">repo2graph/mcp.py</data>
      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">1682</data>
      <data key="d13">1699</data>
      <data key="d14">def _impact_root(index: Index) -&gt; Path:</data>
      <data key="d15">The source tree repo_impact runs git in: the server's indexed root.

    Never `Path.cwd()` -- an MCP client launches the server from wherever it
    likes. In order: the repo the server was started for (`open_index` sets
    `repo_root`), the absolute root the build recorded in manifest.json,
    and finally the index directory's parent (the `&lt;repo&gt;/.r2g` layout).</data>
      <data key="d_nodegraphics">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry x="1411.27" y="1624.60" width="122.50" height="31.85" />
          <y:Fill color="#57C7E3" transparent="false" />
          <y:BorderStyle color="#4a4f57" type="line" width="1.0" />
