      <data key="d14">def fuse_ok(self, embedder: "Embedder") -&gt; tuple[bool, str]:</data>
      <data key="d15">May `embedder`'s query vectors be fused with this index's vectors?

        A silent model or width mismatch is worse than no vectors at all: the
        rankings stay plausible while being meaningless, so the answer is a
        refusal naming both sides rather than a best effort.</data>
