      <data key="d13">429</data>
      <data key="d14">def _boost_identifiers(self, query: str, acc: dict[int, float]) -&gt; None:</data>
      <data key="d15">Multiply the score of chunks the query names outright.

        A pinpoint query like `normalize_provider` should return the symbol, not
        the prose that happens to repeat the word. Only whole identifiers from
        the query count (not tokenize()'s sub-words), and only chunks BM25
        already scored are touched, so score()'s invariants are unchanged.</data>
