      <data key="d12">1038</data>
      <data key="d13">1072</data>
      <data key="d14">def _excerpt_record(chunk: Record, full: str, short: str) -&gt; Record:</data>
      <data key="d15">`chunk` re-cited to the source lines `_compress` actually kept.

    `excerpt_of` keeps the whole chunk's span. The shown span replaces
    `start_line`/`end_line` only where chunk text maps line-for-line onto the
    source from `start_line` -- a whole file or a whole symbol, first part.
    A file residual (symbol spans carved out, then stripped) or a later split
    part does not, so those keep their span and rely on the marker alone.</data>
      <data key="d_nodegraphics">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry x="5716.45" y="1802.60" width="181.50" height="39.00" />
