      <data key="d15">Whether an index still describes the tree it was built from.

    `status` is one of:
      "current"  -- every signal checked agrees the index is up to date
      "stale"    -- at least one signal says it is not
      "unknown"  -- nothing could be checked (no state file, no git, bound hit)</data>
      <data key="d_nodegraphics">
        <y:ShapeNode>
