      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">270</data>
      <data key="d13">292</data>
      <data key="d14">class ScriptedEmbedder:</data>
      <data key="d15">Returns a pre-computed list of vectors, ignoring the texts it is given.

    `score_rrf(embedder=...)` calls `encode([query] + candidate_texts)` with the
    candidates in BM25 order, so a test that has already computed that order can
    hand back exactly the similarities it wants and reason about the fused
    ranking without asserting on any score value.</data>
