      <data key="d14">def test_iss241_a_body_ending_exactly_on_the_ceiling_is_not_truncated(monkeypatch, capsys):</data>
      <data key="d15">The bound is `&gt;`, not `&gt;=`: nothing was dropped, so say nothing.

    The ceiling is lowered for this one case because the point is the exact
    boundary byte, which is unreachable by padding an 8 MiB body to the byte.</data>
