      <data key="d13">305</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_iss241_a_line_spanning_several_read_blocks_is_reassembled(monkeypatch):</data>
      <data key="d15">A delta larger than one read() must arrive whole, not in pieces.

    Reading in blocks only works if the framer rejoins a line split across a
    block boundary; dropping that would corrupt every long delta into unparsable
    JSON and silently shorten the answer.</data>
