      <data key="d13">106</data>
      <data key="d14">def _no_subprocess(monkeypatch):</data>
      <data key="d15">Make any `git` spawn a test failure, not a recorded call.

    A tripwire rather than a recorder on purpose: a validation check placed
    *after* the first git call then fails with this AssertionError, instead of
    passing on the ValueError that would eventually follow anyway.</data>
