      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">1097</data>
      <data key="d13">1120</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_iss233_a_deeply_nested_json_body_is_a_clean_400(make_server):</data>
      <data key="d15">Issue 233: `json.loads` raises RecursionError, which is not a ValueError.

    ~40 KB of nesting is well inside MAX_BODY_BYTES, and this runs before
    `authenticate()`, so any caller that can reach POST /mcp could kill a
    handler thread outright on a server that is otherwise fully locked down.</data>
      <data key="d16">true</data>
      <data key="d17">14</data>
      <data key="d_nodegraphics">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry x="6261.00" y="3685.15" width="163.35" height="35.10" />
          <y:Fill color="#57C7E3" transparent="false" />
          <y:BorderStyle color="#4a4f57" type="line" width="1.0" />
          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" fontSize="11" textColor="#1c2330" visible="true">test_iss233_a_…</y:NodeLabel>
          <y:Shape type="ellipse" />
