      <data key="d13">550</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_iss422_disconnected_rule_needs_two_relatable_files(sample_graph_index):</data>
      <data key="d15">One source file plus any number of unrelatable ones is not an orphan diff.

    pkg/core.py is the only graph-relatable file in this diff, so there is
