      <data key="d13">586</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_iss422_report_states_which_changed_files_the_index_is_missing(sample_graph_index):</data>
      <data key="d15">An index that predates the diff produces a silent wrong answer.

    Nothing can be said about a changed file the index has never seen -- no
    caller, no test, no public API -- and the report has to say so rather than
    render zeros that read like evidence of no impact. This is the shape of an
    index built on the base ref while the diff's line numbers are head-side.</data>
