      <data key="d13">418</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_prod_igy_never_retargets_a_release_pr():</data>
      <data key="d15">A release PR must stay on `main`.

    publish.yml has prod-igy raise `release/vX.Y.Z -&gt; main` and then polls for
    that merge, so retargeting it to `develop` strands the version bump and
    times the release run out with nothing merged.</data>
