      <data key="d14">def split_pack(markdown: str):</data>
      <data key="d15">(map_text, blocks) from a pack_context markdown string.

    src.split("\\n") only -- never splitlines(): chunk text may carry U+2028
    and friends, which splitlines() would treat as line breaks (AGENTS.md).</data>
      <data key="d_nodegraphics">
        <y:ShapeNode>
