      <data key="d14">def test_iss169_writer_uses_stdout_text_not_buffer_bytes(monkeypatch):</data>
      <data key="d15">ISS-169: _writer(None) must write through sys.stdout's text `write`,
    never through sys.stdout.buffer. Writing raw UTF-8 bytes straight to the
    buffer bypasses TextIOWrapper's console codepage translation on Windows,
    producing mojibake with no exception raised.</data>
