      <data key="d14">def test_iss342_self_recursive_function_is_still_an_entrypoint_root(tmp_path):</data>
      <data key="d15">#342: a self-CALLS edge (src == dst) must not disqualify a root.

    `entry` calls only itself and has no external caller, so it must still be
    marked `entrypoint`. `helper`, called by `other`, must not be -- proving
    the fix did not also stop *external* calls from marking a destination.</data>
