    <node id="sym:tests/test_scoped_resolution.py::test_self_recursive_call_resolves_to_itself">
      <data key="d0">sym:tests/test_scoped_resolution.py::test_self_recursive_call_resolves_to_itself</data>
      <data key="d1">symbol</data>
      <data key="d2">test_self_recursive_call_resolves_to_itself</data>
      <data key="d10">test_self_recursive_call_resolves_to_itself</data>
      <data key="d11">function</data>
      <data key="d3">tests/test_scoped_resolution.py</data>
      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">427</data>
      <data key="d13">454</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_self_recursive_call_resolves_to_itself(tmp_path: Path):</data>
      <data key="d15">A top-level function calling its own name recurses; it does not bind elsewhere.

    Every tier filtered the calling symbol out with `c != sid`, so `helper`'s
